      "source": [
        "## Exercises"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "source": [
        "1. Run `code/main.py`. Observe LMPSO convergence. Vary population size 5, 10, 20, 50. At what size does time-to-converge saturate?\n2. Implement a \"catastrophic drift\" experiment: after iteration 30, change the fitness function. How fast does PSO adapt? Does resetting `p_best` help?\n3. Add a quality gate to AMRO-S: pheromone deposit only on runs with eval score > 0.7. How does this change convergence vs the un-gated version?\n4. Read LMPSO (arXiv:2504.09247). Map the paper's \"velocity as a prompt\" back to your numeric velocity. What is lost in the simulation and what is preserved?\n5. Read AMRO-S (arXiv:2603.12933). Implement the decoupled \"inference fast-path\" with asynchronous pheromone update. How does this change system latency under sustained load?"
      ]
    }
